ically in Spain. \"tenemos aquí en España a los planetas, que vienen a recopilar ese sonido tan característico.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"La generación perdida del Indie: SHOEGAZE","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kbiXssvv3aE"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Underappreciated Spanish Indie Pioneers","body":"Los Planetas are considered \"authentic gods\" of independent and indie music in Spain, having introduced significant cultural influences from other countries, particularly classic Anglo-Saxon movements like guitar jangle, and transforming them into distinct interpretations for Spain. Despite their high quality and lasting influence across generations, they have never been fully valued or appreciated outside of independent circles. \"los planetas que son unos auténticos dioses, yo creo que de la música independiente de la música india que en España a pesar de la gran calidad y de haber traído importantes influencias culturales de otros países a España, que después se han ido pasando generación, generación y continuan hoy, nunca han terminado de ser valorados y de apreciados como deberían fuera de los círculos independientes.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"ROSALIA. Por qué la apropiación cultural es un timo.","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PubYV9sbFQw"}]}],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":205718351470660,"type":"album","name":"Super 8","list_id":144321848166418,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Noise Pop","src":"musthear","rank":33,"year":1994,"note":null,"yt":"p1VX2tfYL3Q","scaruffi":null},{"id":173213471081806,"type":"album","name":"Pop","list_id":22099031234954,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Power Pop","src":"musthear","rank":137,"year":1996,"note":null,"yt":"nERw9krjH0U","scaruffi":null},{"id":14780819122386,"type":"album","name":"Una Semana en el Motor de un Autobús","list_id":89365250498738,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Indie Rock","src":"musthear","rank"